Z||000000||TwisT||03-25-2001||06:19 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smoothed.JPG"> <P>Here's a picture I tinkered with using the computer.  Notice the smoothed seams,  and my rims of choice,  18" ADR Euro-blocks.  I also added the nice air-intake,  much like that which Jerry (St. Paul,  MN) sells.<P>What do you guys think?  ;P<P>Brett<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/italbanner3.JPG"> <P>...Website coming soon!||||reg||14
