Z||000025||Nashco||03-26-2001||11:23 PM||||Ha!  Doors?  What do you mean?  This is a sub-10 second fiero...you just lift the nose up like all the other dragsters!  Seriously though, I did get rid of some things that I think would look sweet.  You'll notice my pic has no:<P>1)Gas Filler Door<BR>2)Side Marker Lights<BR>3)Reverse Lights<BR>4)License Plate Recess in Rear Fairing<BR>5)Obviously...shaved handles.<P>I think those things would make for a sweet looking body.  Bad thing is the gas filler would have to be in the trunk or interior, it's hard to see at night backing up, and the license plate recess would be hard to get rid of <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  Besides that, it's totally feasible...er something.  That was a pretty good idea on the chop-top Darklord, I give you props <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  I second that motion on the full-time college thing.  I spent a few minutes avoiding finals studying doing this, but I have a bunch of stuff waiting for me to finish up.  Only three more days, woohoo!<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
